# The web GUI's process (nodo-web-gui, as _nodo_webgui) answers Caddy and asks the helper over
# Unix sockets, which the firewall does not see. It has no business on the network at all, so it
# may send nothing there. The rule sits in a chain of its own: a drop in any chain on the hook
# is final, so it holds whatever other fragments accept in theirs.
table inet monokulo {
	chain web_gui_output {
		type filter hook output priority filter; policy accept;
		meta skuid "_nodo_webgui" drop
	}
}
